        "TileImage": "$($repository d0628b4d-98ac-4fc4-af51-a19eec39bc83).Image",
        "Description": "Percy Blair was admitted to Gama after a rare but fatal form of brain cancer was discovered. Gama claimed to have an experimental but revolutionary treatment that could save his life, but Percy reportedly died on the operating table.\r\r Unsatisfied, the client did some digging and found that Percy never underwent the treatment, instead being neglected for the 3 days he was admitted. The client wants everyone involved dead.\r\rGama is a high security area, so stealth is paramount. Be careful, 47.",
